{"id":"83eb2b67a65ec154","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-constructible-universe.md","title":"Constructible Universe L","display":"df-constructible-universe — Constructible Universe L","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-constructible-universe","aliases":["92-df-constructible-universe","92-df-L"],"display":"df-constructible-universe — Constructible Universe L","depends_on":["[[92-df-zfc]]","[[92-df-first-order-language]]","[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","[[92-df-ordinal]]","[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]"],"source":"原书之外：Gödel 可构造宇宙；本地层级定义","source_status":"外部背景定义；内模型定理未在此重建"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-constructible-universe"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-constructible-universe</span><span>92-df-L</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-constructible-universe — Constructible Universe L"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afb378126cbf5f83\" href=\"?note=afb378126cbf5f83\" title=\"92-df-ordinal\">92-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f1751959740e455f\" href=\"?note=f1751959740e455f\" title=\"92-df-first-order-derivation\">92-df-first-order-derivation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外：Gödel 可构造宇宙；本地层级定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景定义；内模型定理未在此重建"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (class of ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lim}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lim}\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}\\)</span> (formulas and free-variable function for the first-order language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\in\\}\">\\(\\{\\in\\}\\)</span>; 见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a>的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 实例)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\in}\">\\(\\models_{\\in}\\)</span> (satisfaction for membership structures, 见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a>的成员语言语义)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\in)\\models_{\\in}\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\">\\((X,\\in)\\models_{\\in}\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\\)</span> abbreviates satisfaction under the assignment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\mapsto x\">\\(v_0\\mapsto x\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\\mapsto a_i\">\\(v_i\\mapsto a_i\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq i\\leq n\">\\(1\\leq i\\leq n\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}(X),L_\\alpha,L\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}(X),L_\\alpha,L\\)</span> (definition targets)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}universe} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Def}(\\emptyset)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\emptyset\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Def}(X)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\Bigl\\{Y\\subseteq X\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in X^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl[x\\in Y\\Longleftrightarrow(X,\\in)\\models_{\\in}\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\quad(X\\ne\\emptyset),\\\\\nL_0\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\emptyset,\\\\\nL_{\\alpha+1}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\operatorname{Def}(L_\\alpha)\\qquad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}),\\\\\nL_\\lambda\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}L_\\beta\\qquad(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)),\\\\\nL\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{x\\mid\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(x\\in L_\\alpha)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}universe} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Def}(\\emptyset)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\emptyset\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Def}(X)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\Bigl\\{Y\\subseteq X\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in X^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl[x\\in Y\\Longleftrightarrow(X,\\in)\\models_{\\in}\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\quad(X\\ne\\emptyset),\\\\\nL_0\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\emptyset,\\\\\nL_{\\alpha+1}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\operatorname{Def}(L_\\alpha)\\qquad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}),\\\\\nL_\\lambda\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}L_\\beta\\qquad(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)),\\\\\nL\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{x\\mid\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(x\\in L_\\alpha)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可构造宇宙<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}(X)\\)</span>必须允许来自<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>的有限参数；只取无参数可定义子集不会得到标准构造层级</li>\n<li>在通常集合论元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>是包含全部序数的传递真类；它不是集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span>：第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>层的构造</li>\n<li>每个后继层只加入在前一层的成员结构上可由有限层内参数定义的子集</li>\n<li>若环境宇宙满足ZF，则其构造内宇宙<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>满足ZFC以及GCH，因而满足CH</li>\n<li>相容性结论都应相对表述：构造<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>给出相应的ZF 相容蕴涵 ZFC 加上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=L\">\\(V=L\\)</span> 与 GCH 相容论证；forcing则在适当模型假设下给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\neq L\">\\(V\\neq L\\)</span>等相对相容性结果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>空底集不作为普通一阶结构使用；它的唯一子集是空集，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}(\\varnothing)=\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}(\\varnothing)=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1=\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(L_1=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2=\\{\\varnothing,\\{\\varnothing\\}\\}\">\\(L_2=\\{\\varnothing,\\{\\varnothing\\}\\}\\)</span>。每个非空 X 的定义在外部按已建立的有限公式满足关系筛选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>，得到集合；随后按序数递归得到各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为类记号。关于 L 满足 ZFC/GCH 的结果是外部引用背景，不是这份定义已重建的证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"afb378126cbf5f83","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"f1751959740e455f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}$ and $\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}$ (formulas and free-variable function for the first-order language $\\{\\in\\}$; 见[[92-df-first-order-language]]的 $\\mathcal L_\\in$ 实例)","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models_{\\in}$ (satisfaction for membership structures, 见[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]的成员语言语义)","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\in\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\in)\\models_{\\in}\\varphi[x,\\vec a]","display":false},{"tex":"v_0\\mapsto x","display":false},{"tex":"v_i\\mapsto a_i","display":false},{"tex":"1\\leq i\\leq n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}(X),L_\\alpha,L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}universe} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Def}(\\emptyset)\\coloneqq{}&\\{\\emptyset\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Def}(X)\\coloneqq{}&\\Bigl\\{Y\\subseteq X\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in X^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl[x\\in Y\\Longleftrightarrow(X,\\in)\\models_{\\in}\\varphi[x,\\vec a]\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\quad(X\\ne\\emptyset),\\\\\nL_0\\coloneqq{}&\\emptyset,\\\\\nL_{\\alpha+1}\\coloneqq{}&\\operatorname{Def}(L_\\alpha)\\qquad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}),\\\\\nL_\\lambda\\coloneqq{}&\\bigcup_{\\beta<\\lambda}L_\\beta\\qquad(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)),\\\\\nL\\coloneqq{}&\\{x\\mid\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(x\\in L_\\alpha)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"V=L","display":false},{"tex":"V\\neq L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}(\\varnothing)=\\{\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L_1=\\{\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L_2=\\{\\varnothing,\\{\\varnothing\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":3166,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]] → [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]] → [[92-df-first-order-derivation]]供语言扩张与成员语言使用。非标准模型见[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]；集合论背景见[[92-df-zfc]]、[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]、[[92-df-constructible-universe]]、[[92-df-forcing]]与[[92-thm-ch-independence]]。这些背景不冒充原书的算术语法或定理证明。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-constructible-universe]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-constructible-universe]]"}],"outgoing":["66c9470f107a6bad","b230b875687723ed","0b146f0add46bd47","afb378126cbf5f83","f1751959740e455f"]}